 TableBrowse_MultipleInSubForms;parms;globalParms;n;parms1;parms0;table0;tabl1;table1;n1;ng1;ng2
⍝ Shows three tables within three SubForms.
 →0 ⍝ "Table" is not ready yet <Table>
 . ⍝ The "Table" class is under construction and not ready yet
 globalParms←##.APLGUI.APLGuiGlobalParms.CreateDefaults
 globalParms.caption←'Multiple Grids'
 globalParms.icon←⎕NEW'Icon'(⊂'File'(GetFile'Misc\Sample.ico'))
 parms←##.APLGUI.StdForm.CreateParms
 parms.caption←'Three'
 parms.osn←35 55
 n←##.APLGUI.StdForm.Create globalParms parms
 n←##.APLGUI.StdForm.AddTabs n('Table 1' 'Table 2')
 n←##.APLGUI.StdForm.AddButtons n(⊂'Close')
 n.∆buttons.onSelect←1

 parms0←##.APLGUI.Table.CreateParms
 parms0.dataTypes←##.APLGUI.Enums.TableDataTypes.(Character Numeric Character Character Date Time Currency YesNo)
 parms0.colTitles←'Name' 'Type' 'Parent' 'Author' 'Date' 'Time' 'Amount' 'Active'
 parms0.rowTitles←0
 parms0.parent←n.Tab_00_SF
 table0←_CreateTable
 ng1←##.APLGUI.Table.CreateGrid table0 n

 parms1←##.APLGUI.TableViewer.CreateParms
 parms1.dataTypes←##.APLGUI.Enums.TableDataTypes.(Character Character Numeric)
 parms1.colTitles←'First name' 'Last name' 'YoB'
 parms1.parent←n.Tab_01_SF
 table1←⍉⊃('Ronald' 'Bill' 'George' 'Barak')('Reagan' 'Clinton' 'Bush' 'Obama')(1930 1942 1957 1962)
 ng2←##.APLGUI.Table.CreateGrid table1 n

 n.∆Form.Wait
 n.∆CloseForm

⍝Done
